    {
      "id": "msg_0040_00117",
      "en_US": "Sabrina: Your mother packed\nenough for three people. I\rchecked.\rShe said your father used to\nforget his lunch in Saffron,\rtoo."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0040_00118",
      "en_US": "Sabrina: Your sister has already\nturned this into a race.\rWe can walk. I am not giving her\nthe satisfaction of seeing me\rrun."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0040_00119",
      "en_US": "Sabrina: Sprout Tower sways with\nthe wind. They train in it\rdaily.\rI would like to try that.\nPreferably without an audience."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0040_00120",
      "en_US": "Sabrina: Falkner took that loss\nwell. Pride can make that hard.\rNo, that was not a hint. Not\nentirely."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0040_00121",
      "en_US": "Sabrina: This town feels uneasy.\nLet us find out why.\rOne thing at a time. You do not\nhave to solve it all alone."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0040_00122",
      "en_US": "Sabrina: Hearing those Slowpoke\nagain is a relief.\rI missed that particular noise.\nDo not tell your sister."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0040_00123",
      "en_US": "Sabrina: I forgot how crowded\nGoldenrod gets.\rYour sister asked if I would\nteleport us somewhere quieter.\rI said probably not. She found\nthat unhelpful."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0040_00124",
      "en_US": "Sabrina: No more Rocket\nbroadcasts. The ordinary adverts\rwill do.\rYes, even the very loud ones."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0040_00125",
      "en_US": "Sabrina: People here know how to\nsit with a difficult memory.\rThere is discipline in that. It\nis not always the quiet kind."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0040_00126",
      "en_US": "Sabrina: The sea air suits me.\nThe wind does not suit my hair.\rYou can stop smiling now."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0040_00127",
      "en_US": "Sabrina: The lighthouse is\nshining again. Good.\rI was beginning to worry about\nmore than the ships."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0040_00128",
      "en_US": "Sabrina: That shopkeeper watches\nthe road a little too closely.\rWe should keep our eyes open."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0040_00129",
      "en_US": "Sabrina: Lance knew what he was\ndoing down there.\rI am glad you trusted him. You\nmake a good team."
    },
    {
